    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      108.72,
      387.91,
      285.72,
      409.52
    ],
    "text": "My No.: MOR/LAN/01/F1/186. Land Min.\u2019s Ref. No.: LD/05/2009/VE/154.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      431.83,
      288.96,
      500.24
    ],
    "text": "IN the view of the Government decides to acquire the following land for public purpose, I hereby notice the decision under the Sub section (1) of the Section 7 of the Land Acquition Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      504.07,
      288.77,
      609.68
    ],
    "text": "Details of the Land to be acquired: Allotments containing 0.0347 Hectares, which mentioned as Lot Nos. 513 and 514 of the cadastral plan No. 520212/05/02 and dated 30.09.2016 of the Surveyor General and situated at Angulana (within the Moratuwa Urban Council area) in Moratuwa Divisional Secretariat area in the Colombo District of Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      16.078292846679688
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      613.52,
      286.42,
      687.92
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 513 Name of the Land: Not mentioned; Claimant: Government: First Claimant Weligamage Keerthipala Silva of No. 334, Beach Road, Angulana; Extent: 0.0122 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      332.72,
      539.62,
      393.2
    ],
    "text": "02. Lot No. 514 Name of the Land: Madangahawaththa, Gewatta; Claimant: Government; First Claimant; Weligamage Keerthipala Silva of No. 334, Beach Road, Angulana; Extent: 0.0225 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      394.64,
      544.45,
      462.8
    ],
    "text": "All those who claim ownerships, entitlements or any other connectedness for the said land or persons having power of attorney delegated by them are requested to meet me at Moratuwa Divisional Secretariat, At 09.30 a.m. on 28th June 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      464.0,
      539.6,
      557.6
    ],
    "text": "In addition, they should inform me in written with two copies of nature of their entitlements, reasons of claiming compensation with regard to the acquisition of the land compensation amount and how it has been calculated before 21st June 2017. Relevant deeds and documents should be presented in the interview in order to prove the entitlements.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      555.92,
      539.64,
      602.48
    ],
    "text": "H. R. H. KARUNARATHNE Divisional Secretary, and Land Acquiring Officer, Moratuwa.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
